.953">never </span><span begin="00:48.953" end="00:51.113">learn</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.922" end="00:54.801"><span begin="00:51.922" end="00:52.265">I </span><span begin="00:52.265" end="00:52.521">don't </span><span begin="00:52.521" end="00:52.729">know </span><span begin="00:52.729" end="00:53.041">how </span><span begin="00:53.041" end="00:53.385">to </span><span begin="00:53.385" end="00:53.729">fake </span><span begin="00:53.729" end="00:54.417">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.801" end="00:57.001"><span begin="00:54.801" end="00:55.017">When </span><span begin="00:55.017" end="00:55.217">we're </span><span begin="00:55.217" end="00:56.865">disintegrating</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.001" end="00:59.353"><span begin="00:57.001" end="00:57.433">No </span><span begin="00:57.433" end="00:58.921">return</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.353" end="01:03.241"><span begin="00:59.353" end="00:59.729">We'll </span><span begin="00:59.729" end="01:00.225">crash </span><span begin="01:00.225" end="01:00.793">and </span><span begin="01:00.793" end="01:02.465">burn</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.241" end="01:07.393"><span begin="01:03.241" end="01:03.617">You </span><span begin="01:03.617" end="01:03.993">picked </span><span begin="01:03.993" end="01:04.529">him </span><span begin="01:04.529" end="01:05.265">over </span><span begin="01:05.265" end="01:05.985">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.393" end="01:14.569"><span begin="01:07.393" end="01:07.785">And </span><span begin="01:07.785" end="01:08.177">you </span><span begin="01:08.177" end="01:08.545">left </span><span begin="01:08.545" end="01:08.897">with </span><span begin="01:08.897" end="01:09.553">no </span><span begin="01:09.553" end="01:11.617">apology</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.569" end="01:18.761"><span begin="01:14.569" end="01:14.921">Felt </span><span begin="01:14.921" end="01:15.281">a </span><span begin="01:15.281" end="01:15.7